# --- lock-park (DE-LOCKPARK-CONVENTION) ---
# A lock a builder could not unlink is parked, never committed. See _meta/conventions.md.
_git_locks_to_delete/
_to_delete/
.locks-aside/
stale-locks-*/
parked-locks/

# --- never-source (added 2026-09-08 — Jukka: crap or private files must never reach GitHub/Vercel) ---
# The Distribution Engineer sweeps `git add -A` every 15 min. A working file left in the tree by any
# session becomes a commit, and on a static site a live URL (saunahash's index.html.bak was served with
# HTTP 200 for five days). These classes are never source, whoever leaves them here. Canonical copy:
# _meta/project-template/repo.gitignore — keep the two in step.
*.bak
*.bak.*
*.bak-*
*.orig
*~
*.tmp
*.swp
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
_iotest*
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
